r_undefined0small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1404543012">November 2, 2015</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">I really enjoyed this book. I wasn't sure going in to it what the actually story was about, but once it was reveal I found it interesting and exciting. Allie was a strong, fun heroine, but she had a compassionate side too. I like how the characters, male and female, were equally strong and weak, not just having the women be strong - cause to me those stories are annoying. I'm really curious to see where the next book will take the story. I recommend this to fans of YA paranormal.<br /><br /><i>I received a complimentary copy of this book to review. I was asked to give my honest opinion of the book - which I have done.</i></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5372197?shelf=2015-family-fortunes" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2015-family-fortunes</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5372197?shelf=2015-the-creature-challenge" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2015-the-creature-challenge</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5372197?shelf=new-to-me-authors-2015" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">new-to-me-authors-2015</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button