pename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"supernatural-powers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/36537194?shelf=supernatural-powers"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1350211887"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Uva7RYI7FvIiQQVPztGkzg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Uva7RYI7FvIiQQVPztGkzg","creator":{"__ref":"User:36537194"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1470513745594,"createdAt":1438306838000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1453387556000,"text":"In Emerge: The Awakening, we meet Allie, a diminutive teenage girl with fiery red hair and a snarky attitude. She has been on the run, moving from place to place, her entire life, and she's had nary a clue as to why.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut that changes when she meets Aidan, a handsome boy who explains to her that she is an Immortal, a being of incredible untapped power who is about to undergo a change that will transform her life completely.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA fantastic premise, to be sure, and I dove right into the story, which caught my attention with its great characters and dialogue. Allie is wonderfully snarky, which I love, and the interplay between Allie and Aidan was the highlight of the book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe reason I could not give this book five stars was because, in my opinion, there were time when I felt that there was too much dialogue and not enough exposition. There were many flashbacks, and there were many, many characters (too many to keep track of), and there were a couple of times when I found myself a little lost.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is a fantastic book, and definitely worth reading. My advice: don't get caught up trying to remember all the characters. Just focus on Allie and Aidan and a few other main characters, and you'll be fine.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCan't wait to see what happens to Allie next. Well done, Ms. Craven!\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2T96J2PGDTKPE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.G3rRAsyyTxfuwJll0Wx1fQ\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:42262088":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":42262088,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":1,"name":"Bailee Harris","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/42262088-bailee-harris","contributor":null,"id":42262088},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2CU5RXA85M5N2":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2CU5RXA85M5N2"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2CU5RXA85M5N2\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.aYXjK-bYfGLdUO-krJoFkQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2CU5RXA85M5N2","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2CU5RXA85M5N2"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.aYXjK-bYfGLdUO-krJoFkQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.aYXjK-bYfGLdUO-krJoFkQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/42262088?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1257716524"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qQLJSNaWzNGmf2nxHCIuLg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qQLJSNaWzNGmf2nxHCIuLg","creator":{"__ref":"User:42262088"},"recommendFor":"14 and up","updatedAt":1466694477476,"createdAt":1429326414000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1429327140000,"text":"Emerge! Exactly what I was looking for!\u003cbr /\u003eGet prepared to be taken on an unpredictable journey. I was drawn to this book by the amazing cover art and when I read the book blurb I thought \"finally\"...an author who is not following the pack on the typical dystopian, dark and depressing trend that seems to be everywhere lately. I am so excited I took a chance on this awesome indie author. Her characters have such wonderful depth and the setting makes me want to visit Cleveland. Seriously, who knew they had islands in Ohio? \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI absolutely loved Allie. I love a story where I actually am able to laugh and cry with the characters I am reading about. Even though she is this extraordinary girl with powerful gifts, Allie is very grounded in reality. One the best things about this series is that the author has made everything so believable. She has woven such a creative storyline that is truly one of a kind. I was totally blown away.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is a refreshing new series with an unbelievable ending. Can't wait for book two.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2CU5RXA85M5N2\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.aYXjK-bYfGLdUO-krJoFkQ\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:28086295":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":28086295,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1490205684i/28086295._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":95,"textReviewsCount":2280,"name":"Sharon Mariampillai","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/28086295-sharon-mariampillai","contributor":null,"id":28086295},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A4ZPAXTE82NEH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A4ZPAXTE82NEH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A4ZPAXTE82NEH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.G3rRAsyyTxfuwJll0Wx1fQ\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A4ZPAXTE82NEH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A4ZPAXTE82NEH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://b